# Licensing and attribution

DPGP is developed from the C-WAH and TDW-MAT implementations distributed in
[CoELA](https://github.com/UMass-Embodied-AGI/CoELA), associated with *Building
Cooperative Embodied Agents Modularly with Large Language Models* by Hongxin
Zhang, Weihua Du, Jiaming Shan, Qinhong Zhou, Yilun Du, Joshua B. Tenenbaum,
Tianmin Shu, and Chuang Gan.

DPGP modifies and extends those implementations with HiddenCoop, a benchmark
for tasks with hidden cooperation requirements, and Discovery-Probability
Graph Planning (DPGP), a method for coordinating exploration and transport.
The modifications also include cooperative action interfaces, communication
and embodied execution-time accounting, and experiment runners and evaluation.
These modifications are contributions of the DPGP contributors; the original
authors retain copyright in their work. Attribution does not imply endorsement
by the upstream authors.

## License scope

The repository uses the component licenses below, subject to any separately
identified third-party licenses and notices. This file identifies their scope;
it does not replace or amend the referenced license texts.

| Material | Applicable license |
| --- | --- |
| `cwah/`: the C-WAH-derived implementation and DPGP contributions in this component | Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), provided in [cwah/LICENSE.md](cwah/LICENSE.md) |
| `tdw_mat/`: the TDW-MAT-derived implementation and DPGP contributions in this component | MIT License, provided in [tdw_mat/LICENSE](tdw_mat/LICENSE) |
| DPGP-authored documentation and figures outside the two components, including the root README and `assets/`, unless otherwise identified | CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, with the license text provided in [cwah/LICENSE.md](cwah/LICENSE.md) |

The licenses in this table are granted for the DPGP contributions by their
respective copyright holders. They do not grant rights in third-party material
beyond the rights available under that material's applicable license.

## Preserved upstream notices

The C-WAH license text is retained from
[CoELA's C-WAH license](https://github.com/UMass-Embodied-AGI/CoELA/blob/master/cwah/LICENSE.md).
Redistribution and adaptation of that material must comply with CC BY-NC-SA 4.0,
including its attribution, indication-of-changes, noncommercial, and share-alike
conditions. The full [CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 legal code](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode.en)
governs those permissions and conditions.

The MIT text in `tdw_mat/LICENSE` is retained from
[CoELA's TDW-MAT license](https://github.com/UMass-Embodied-AGI/CoELA/blob/master/tdw_mat/LICENSE),
including the original notice: **Copyright (c) 2023 Esther Alter**. Retain the
copyright and permission notices as required by that license. DPGP contributions
to this component are also made available under its MIT terms; this does not
transfer ownership of the upstream work to the DPGP contributors.

Any separately identified third-party material retains its own license and
notices. Moving or copying material between directories does not change its
license; in particular, C-WAH-derived material does not become MIT-licensed by
being placed under `tdw_mat/`.

## External dependencies and assets

VirtualHome, TDW, their simulator executables, downloaded scene and model assets,
and other external dependencies retain their own licenses and terms. Their
download or use through DPGP does not relicense them under this file.

The warranty disclaimers and limitations of liability in the applicable license
texts remain in effect.